[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Section 2 [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mDoes the data model look right?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mLooks right, continue[39m
     [38;5;246mFive tables, notifications referencing events, muted as a column, actor excluded, idempotent fan-out via the unique
[39m     [38;5;246mconstraint.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Denormalize notifications
     [38;5;246mYou'd rather each notification carry its own rendered text/payload instead of joining through to the event.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Revisit event kinds
     [38;5;246mThe list of tracked change types is wrong — too granular, too coarse, or missing something like comments.[39m
  [38;5;246m4. Type something.[39m
